IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `faa-conduct`

-- Financial Advisers Act 2001, ss 35, 36, 39, 41 to 43, 45 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_faa.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a careless misstatement of surrender charges that cost the client` MEANS Statement WITH
    `false or misleading, or omitted a material matter` IS TRUE
    `the adviser knew, ought to have known, or did not care` IS TRUE
    `the client relied on it` IS TRUE
    `the reliance was reasonable` IS TRUE
    `the client suffered loss` IS TRUE

`a careless misstatement the client never relied on` MEANS Statement WITH
    `false or misleading, or omitted a material matter` IS TRUE
    `the adviser knew, ought to have known, or did not care` IS TRUE
    `the client relied on it` IS FALSE
    `the reliance was reasonable` IS FALSE
    `the client suffered loss` IS TRUE

`an honest error no one could have caught` MEANS Statement WITH
    `false or misleading, or omitted a material matter` IS TRUE
    `the adviser knew, ought to have known, or did not care` IS FALSE
    `the client relied on it` IS TRUE
    `the reliance was reasonable` IS TRUE
    `the client suffered loss` IS TRUE

`an omission of lock-in terms relied on but causing no loss` MEANS Statement WITH
    `false or misleading, or omitted a material matter` IS TRUE
    `the adviser knew, ought to have known, or did not care` IS TRUE
    `the client relied on it` IS TRUE
    `the reliance was reasonable` IS TRUE
    `the client suffered loss` IS FALSE

`a fact-find, product research and a fitting recommendation` MEANS Recommendation WITH
    `considered the client's objectives, situation and needs` IS TRUE
    `investigated the product reasonably` IS TRUE
    `the recommendation was based on that work` IS TRUE
    `the client relied reasonably` IS TRUE
    `the client suffered loss` IS TRUE

`a recommendation without a fact-find that lost money` MEANS Recommendation WITH
    `considered the client's objectives, situation and needs` IS FALSE
    `investigated the product reasonably` IS TRUE
    `the recommendation was based on that work` IS TRUE
    `the client relied reasonably` IS TRUE
    `the client suffered loss` IS TRUE

`a recommendation without product research the client ignored` MEANS Recommendation WITH
    `considered the client's objectives, situation and needs` IS TRUE
    `investigated the product reasonably` IS FALSE
    `the recommendation was based on that work` IS TRUE
    `the client relied reasonably` IS FALSE
    `the client suffered loss` IS TRUE

`an unresearched recommendation that made money` MEANS Recommendation WITH
    `considered the client's objectives, situation and needs` IS TRUE
    `investigated the product reasonably` IS FALSE
    `the recommendation was based on that work` IS TRUE
    `the client relied reasonably` IS TRUE
    `the client suffered loss` IS FALSE

§ `s 35`

#ASSERT `the statement contravenes section 35` `a careless misstatement of surrender charges that cost the client`
#ASSERT `the statement contravenes section 35` `a careless misstatement the client never relied on`
#ASSERT NOT `the statement contravenes section 35` `an honest error no one could have caught`
#ASSERT `the statement contravenes section 35` `an omission of lock-in terms relied on but causing no loss`

#ASSERT `the client can claim damages for the statement` `a careless misstatement of surrender charges that cost the client`
#ASSERT NOT `the client can claim damages for the statement` `a careless misstatement the client never relied on`
#ASSERT NOT `the client can claim damages for the statement` `an honest error no one could have caught`
#ASSERT NOT `the client can claim damages for the statement` `an omission of lock-in terms relied on but causing no loss`

§ `s 36`

#ASSERT `there is a reasonable basis` `a fact-find, product research and a fitting recommendation`
#ASSERT NOT `there is a reasonable basis` `a recommendation without a fact-find that lost money`
#ASSERT NOT `there is a reasonable basis` `a recommendation without product research the client ignored`
#ASSERT NOT `there is a reasonable basis` `an unresearched recommendation that made money`

#ASSERT NOT `the client can claim damages for the recommendation` `a fact-find, product research and a fitting recommendation`
#ASSERT `the client can claim damages for the recommendation` `a recommendation without a fact-find that lost money`
#ASSERT NOT `the client can claim damages for the recommendation` `a recommendation without product research the client ignored`
#ASSERT NOT `the client can claim damages for the recommendation` `an unresearched recommendation that made money`

§ `s 39`

#ASSERT `the contract remains enforceable` TRUE
#ASSERT `the contract remains enforceable` FALSE

§ `ss 41 to 43`

#ASSERT `the security over the premium account is valid` `a lien for the adviser's unpaid fees`
#ASSERT NOT `the security over the premium account is valid` `a lien for a debt owed by the client on another matter`
#ASSERT NOT `the security over the premium account is valid` `a charge in favour of the adviser's bank`

#ASSERT `the placement is lawful` `a licensed insurer` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the placement is lawful` `an unlicensed insurer for a Singapore risk` FALSE
#ASSERT `the placement is lawful` `an unlicensed insurer for a Singapore risk` TRUE
#ASSERT `the placement is lawful` `an unlicensed insurer for reinsurance` FALSE
#ASSERT `the placement is lawful` `an unlicensed insurer for an overseas risk` FALSE

#ASSERT `the adviser commits a section 43 offence` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the adviser commits a section 43 offence` TRUE FALSE

§ `s 45`

#ASSERT `the circular contravenes section 45` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the circular contravenes section 45` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the circular contravenes section 45` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the circular contravenes section 45` FALSE FALSE FALSE

